WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
With an image selected, expand Copy to pages in Image details.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Enter the target page numbers and choose Copy to 3 pages.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.500
A confirmation reports that the image was copied to three other pages.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:16.430
Open the target pages and check that each copy has the same size and position.
